// partner-invite: one branded invitation e-mail for the Partner Program, sent from the support Gmail.
// The e-mail carries the secure link to create the password (generated by Supabase Auth, not sent by Supabase).
// Called by the admin console (Partners → New partner / Resend invitation / Delete / Approve / Contract) with the admin's session.
// Public: self sign-up from partners.html (action signup) and the hook called by sign.html after a signature (action envelope_signed).
// Partner (own session): contract_self generates the agreement with the default commission (10%) and returns the signing link.
// The account is activated automatically (partner_try_activate) when every onboarding step is done.
// Partner agreement: generated PDF (partner-contract.js) signed with the Endeavor e-signature module, partner first, then Endeavor.
